    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27047" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῐ-λήμμᾰτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>involving two propositions,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συλλογισμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					<u>Inst.Log.</u>
					6.5
				</span></i>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τον, τό,</span>
			<i>dilemma,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Inv.</u>
				4.6
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span> Ulp.ad <i><span class="en">
				D.
				3.13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>ambiguous,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέξεις</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				480
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>two-handled,</i>
			
				gloss on 
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιδέξιος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				699.41
			</span></i>.</div>
